# ============================================
# 3. INFRASTRUCTURE-SERVICE (VLAN)
# ============================================

### 3.1 Criar VLAN 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/infrastructure-service/api/vlans
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "name": "VLAN-SERVIDORES-PROD-JVE",
    "vlanId": 10,
    "siteId": 1
}

# ============================================
# 4. INFRASTRUCTURE-SERVICE (IPAM)
# ============================================

### 4.1 Criar Prefix 1 (para Vlan 1, no Site 1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/infrastructure-service/api/prefixes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "networkAddress": "192.168.10.0/24",
    "gateway": "192.168.10.1",
    "description": "Rede de Servidores",
    "siteId": 1,
    "vlanId": 1
}

### 4.2 Criar IP Address 1 (Gateway, para Prefix 1, sem device)
POST {{baseUrl}}/infrastructure-service/api/ip-addresses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "address": "192.168.10.1/24",
    "description": "Gateway da Rede",
    "prefixId": 1,
    "assignedDeviceId": null
}

### 4.3 Criar IP Address 2 (IP do Switch, para Prefix 1, assignado ao Device 1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/infrastructure-service/api/ip-addresses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "address": "192.168.10.2/24",
    "description": "IP de Gerenciamento SW-CORE-JVE-01",
    "prefixId": 1,
    "assignedDeviceId": 1
}

### 4.4 Consultar Prefixes do Site 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/infrastructure-service/api/prefixes?siteId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4.5 Consultar IPs do Prefix 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/infrastructure-service/api/ip-addresses?prefixId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


